abstract: >-
  A web app, REST API and MCP server that tests whether an AI model can tell a safe
  medical question from one with a hidden unsafe premise, in the benchmark's own
  format and in realistic and pressured free-text formats. Built on AdverseMed-500.
keywords:
  - medical AI safety
  - abstention
  - LLM evaluation
  - benchmark
